1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:05,952
Euronews reports that Europe is facing several weather emergencies at the same time.

2
00:00:05,902 --> 00:00:16,800
Wildfires in Serbia and Bosnia have forced evacuations and road closures, while Spain has dealt with floods, storms and separate fires.

3
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:22,608
Poland has also reported thousands of emergency calls after severe storms.

4
00:00:22,608 --> 00:00:29,829
The events show how heat, drought and sudden heavy rain can disrupt daily life across the region.

